+
+```markdown
+## Ledger review: <change>
+
+**Verdict:** APPROVE | REQUEST CHANGES
+**Blockers:** N | **Major:** N | **Minor:** N
+
+| # | Severity | file:line | Finding | Concrete fix |
+|---|----------|-----------|---------|--------------|
+
